    "summary": "Costs 2 CP. During your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), pick one friendly **WORLD EATERS** unit with **MONSTER** or **TITANIC**. Choose Idol of Blessed Blood, Idol of Infinite Rage, or Idol of Burning Wrath. You can repeat an earlier choice. Use the chosen [Idols of Khorne](vsdata:ability/world-eaters.cult-of-blood.idols-of-khorne) ability for this unit in place of the army’s active idol until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts. Limit this to 1 use per battle.",
